  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">9th PanAfrican Conference and Workshop on Sanitary/Phytosanitary(SPS) Regulations and Science-based Risk Analysis to Promote Agricultural Trade in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuskegee University (TU) will conduct a Conference and workshop in Sanitary and Phytosanitary regulations and science-based risk analysis for African government officials and academics. The activity will take place in Nairobi, Kenya, from June 10 to June 21, 2024. TU will plan, organize and deliver a two-day conference and an eight-day workshop. About 40 participants will attend from up to 15 African countries.</narrative>
  </description>
